<title>UK: BremerLB sets $200 million bond due December 1999.</title>
<headline>BremerLB sets $200 million bond due December 1999.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers Commerzbank and UBS Ltd.</p>
<p> BORROWER   BREMER LANDESBANK</p>
<p> AMT	  $200 MLN  COUPON     6.375     MATURITY    29.DEC.99</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.075   PAY DATE    09.JUN.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.25	REOFFER    99.975    SPREAD	=</p>
<p> MOODY	AA1	 LISTING    LONDON    PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> IBCA	 AAA	 DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US/GB/DE</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.10	SELL CONC  0.15	PRAECIPUUM  NONE</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
